* A5_enhanced_core_cascoded_boosters, testbench A_dc
* LTspice netlist (PTM 90 nm). Open in LTspice (File > Open, all files) and Run.
* DC transfer: plot -I(Vo) and V(inn) against Iin; error in %% = 100*(-I(Vo)-Iin)/Iin.
.include ptm90.lib
Vdd vdd 0 1
Vcn vcn 0 0.42
Vo out 0 0.5
Ibf vdd y 2e-06
M1C y G1 x 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M1 x y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
Vjoin inn x 0
M2C out G2 x2 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M2 x2 y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
Ibo vdd out 2e-06
Ia1 vdd G1 2e-07
Ia2 vdd G2 2e-07
MA1 a1 x 0 0 nmos90 W=8u L=360n
MA2 a2 x2 0 0 nmos90 W=8u L=360n
Cc1 G1 0 0.3p
Cc2 G2 0 0.3p
Vcb vcb 0 0.45
MK1 G1 vcb a1 0 nmos90 W=2u L=360n
MK2 G2 vcb a2 0 nmos90 W=2u L=360n
Iin 0 inn 10u AC 1
.dc Iin 0 20u 0.25u
.meas DC iout_10u FIND -I(Vo) AT=10u
.meas DC err_10u_pct PARAM 100*(iout_10u-10u)/10u
.meas DC vin_10u FIND V(inn) AT=10u
.meas DC iout_2u FIND -I(Vo) AT=2u
.meas DC err_2u_pct PARAM 100*(iout_2u-2u)/2u
.backanno
.end
